{
  "name": "Memento MCP",
  "description": "Memento MCP is a high-performance knowledge graph memory system designed for Large Language Models using the Model Context Protocol. It implements a temporal knowledge graph with native Neo4j support for unified graph and vector storage, enabling semantic retrieval through OpenAI embeddings. The system features sophisticated relationship management including temporal versioning, confidence decay, and hybrid search capabilities for persistent ontological memory.",
